","translation":"(is the) Command","transliteration":"amru"},{"position":3,"text":"ٱللَّهِ","translation":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi"},{"position":4,"text":"أَنزَلَهُۥٓ","translation":"which He has sent down","transliteration":"anzalahu"},{"position":5,"text":"إِلَيْكُمْ ۚ","translation":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum"},{"position":6,"text":"وَمَن","translation":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman"},{"position":7,"text":"يَتَّقِ","translation":"fears","transliteration":"yattaqi"},{"position":8,"text":"ٱللَّهَ","translation":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha"},{"position":9,"text":"يُكَفِّرْ","translation":"He will remove","transliteration":"yukaffir"},{"position":10,"text":"عَنْهُ","translation":"from him","transliteration":"ʿanhu"},{"position":11,"text":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِۦ","translation":"his evil deeds","transliteration":"sayyiātihi"},{"position":12,"text":"وَيُعْظِمْ","translation":"and make great","transliteration":"wayuʿ'ẓim"},{"position":13,"text":"لَهُۥٓ","translation":"for him","transliteration":"lahu"},{"position":14,"text":"أَجْرًا","translation":"(his) reward","transliteration":"ajran"}]},{"id":5223,"verseKey":"65:6","verseNumber":6,"arabic":"أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ مِنْ حَيْثُ سَكَنتُم مِّن وُجْدِكُمْ وَلَا تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ ۚ وَإِن كُنَّ أُو۟لَـٰتِ حَمْلٍ فَأَنفِقُوا۟ عَلَيْهِنَّ حَتَّىٰ يَضَعْنَ حَمْلَهُنَّ ۚ فَإِنْ أَرْضَعْنَ لَكُمْ فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ أُجُورَهُنَّ ۖ وَأْتَمِرُوا۟ بَيْنَكُم بِمَعْرُوفٍ ۖ وَإِن تَعَاسَرْتُمْ فَسَتُرْضِعُ لَهُۥٓ أُخْرَىٰ","translation":"Lodge them [in a section] of where you dwell out of your means and do not harm them in order to oppress them. And if they should be pregnant, then spend on them until they give birth. And if they breastfeed for you, then give them their payment and confer among yourselves in the acceptable way; but if you are in discord, then there may breastfeed for him [i.e., the father] another woman.","transliteration":"askinūhunna min ḥaythu sakantum min wuj'dikum walā tuḍ